          "_name": "features6",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features5\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <select title=\"Cards\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\" selected>2</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showsubTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Colors</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Bg\" name=\"cardColor\" value=\"#fafafa\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon 1\" name=\"cardColor2\" value=\"#ffe161\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon 2\" name=\"cardColor3\" value=\"#e43f3f\" selected condition=\"cardsAmount > 1\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background3.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-lg-6\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper mbr-flex\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-left mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showsubTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n                            Elevate your business\n                        </h6>\n                        <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style align-left mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\"><b>Email Deliverability &amp; Domain Health</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">- SPF, DKIM, and DMARC audit and setup<br>- Inbox placement analysis (Gmail, Outlook)<br>- Sender reputation assessment<br>- Spam trigger and content risk review<br>- Engagement-based sending strategy<br>- Deliverability recovery for damaged domains</p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a href=\"https://mobiri.se\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn more</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"img-wrapper img1 align-center\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-letter mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-lg-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper mbr-flex\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-left mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showsubTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n                            Elevate your business\n                        </h6>\n                        <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style align-left mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\"><b><br></b><b>Domain Warm-Up &amp; Sending Readiness</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">- New domain warm-up planning<br>- Recovery warm-up for cold or blocked domains<br>- Safe daily sending volume strategy<br>- Gradual ramp-up based on engagement signals<br>- Monitoring during warm-up phase<br><br></p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                            <a href=\"https://mobiri.se\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn more</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"img-wrapper img2 align-center\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-globe-2 mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
