          "_name": "clients2",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"clients2\" group=\"Clients\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Cards</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"BG\" name=\"cardColor\" value=\"#eae7dc\" selected>\n        <select title=\"Amount\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background3.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-4': cardsAmount < 4,\n                            'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == 4}\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"img-wrapper\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/osteostrong-verticallogo-yellowwhite-1920w-.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n                         Our Clients\n                        </h6>\n                        <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Osteo Strong</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                            Osteo Strong has had the pleasure of collaborating with Ayesha Fatima, whose expertise in digital marketing and Zoho CRM implementation has revolutionized our operations. Ayesha's strategic handling of Google Ads and social media outreach directly contributed to an exceptional 40% increase in our ROI. Her dedication and innovative approach have significantly propelled Osteo Strong's success and prominence in the fitness services sector.</p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnAdd, -mbrBtnMove, -mbrBtnRemove\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn More</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-4': cardsAmount < 4,\n                            'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == 4}\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"img-wrapper\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/06ihonavfr3rkfhdjbvaxzm.fit-limit.size-400x400.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n                            Our Clients\n                        </h6>\n                        <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Madera Outdoor</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                            Working with Ayesha Fatima has been a game-changer for Madera Outdoor. Her expertise in digital marketing and the setup of Klaviyo automations has significantly streamlined our operations. Ayesha's strategic management of Google Ads and social media outreach led to an exceptional 50% increase in our Return on Advertising Spend (ROAS). Her dedication and innovative approach have profoundly impacted our success, positioning Madera Outdoor as a prominent e-commerce brand in the outdoor products market. </p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnAdd, -mbrBtnMove, -mbrBtnRemove\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn More</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 2\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-4': cardsAmount < 4,\n                            'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == 4}\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"img-wrapper\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/soul-homes-1.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n                            Our Clients\n                        </h6>\n                        <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Soul Homes</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                            Ayesha Fatima's impact on Soul Homes Real Estate has been invaluable. Her adept skills in digital marketing, along with the successful implementation of HubSpot CRM and Marketing Hub automations, have truly set us apart. With Ayesha's personalized approach to our PPC campaigns and social media outreach, we've witnessed a remarkable, genuine expansion of our buyer and seller audience. Her genuine dedication has fostered a deep connection, making Soul Homes more than just a real estate entity, but a trustworthy, relatable guide in our customers' home journeys.</p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnAdd, -mbrBtnMove, -mbrBtnRemove\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn More</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 3\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-4': cardsAmount < 4,\n                            'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == 4}\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"img-wrapper\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/1-1.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n                            Our Clients\n                        </h6>\n                        <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Our partner</b>\n                        </h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                            Each theme in the Mobirise site builder contains a set of unique blocks.</p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnAdd, -mbrBtnMove, -mbrBtnRemove\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn More</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
