          "_name": "features13",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features13\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Button\" name=\"showButton\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#e43f3f\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showText || showButton\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\"><b>What I Do</b></h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">I help businesses fix the underlying systems that determine whether emails reach the inbox, get opened, and generate real conversations. Most email problems are not caused by copy or tools, but by poor infrastructure, weak sender reputation, and unqualified targeting. My role is to identify and correct those issues before campaigns or outreach are scaled.<br><br>My approach combines email deliverability, outbound strategy, and data-driven growth. Instead of relying on volume or shortcuts, I focus on building clean, compliant, and scalable systems that support long-term performance. This allows businesses to generate consistent leads, protect their domain reputation, and grow without running into spam or deliverability issues.</p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-if=\"showButton\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"EmailOutbound.html#gallery5-2i\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">View Case Studies</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6\">\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper mbr-flex\">\n                        <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-globe-2 mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-box\">\n                            <h4 class=\"icon-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\"><b>Fixing and protecting email domain health</b></h4>\n                            <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\">I audit and configure SPF, DKIM, and DMARC correctly, monitor sender reputation, and ensure inbox providers trust your domain before any campaign is scaled.</h5>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper mbr-flex\">\n                        <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-update mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-box\">\n                            <h4 class=\"icon-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\"><b>Building safe, scalable outreach systems</b></h4>\n                            <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\">I design outreach and automation workflows that follow proper sending behavior, engagement-based ramp-up, and platform best practices to avoid spam flags and domain damage.</h5>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper mbr-flex\">\n                        <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-user-2 mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-box\">\n                            <h4 class=\"icon-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\"><b><br></b><b>High-intent prospects using data enrichment &amp; ABM</b></h4>\n                            <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\">I use data enrichment and account-based targeting to reach decision-makers who are most likely to convert, instead of mass emailing low-quality lists.</h5>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"item features-without-image\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper mbr-flex\">\n                        <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-speed mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-box\">\n                            <h4 class=\"icon-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\"><b><br>Supporting long-term growth without damaging sender reputation</b></h4>\n                            <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\">Every system I build is designed to protect inbox placement over time, allowing businesses to grow email volume confidently without sacrificing deliverability or trust.</h5>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vbWcPmRc9o",
          "_anchor": "features13-1z",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
